---
type: readme
title: Profile shortcut icon migration notes
summary: Explains that whenever chromium.ico changes, kCurrentProfileIconVersion in profile_shortcut_manager_win.cc must be incremented so runtime-generated profile shortcut icons are migrated.
---

Whenever chromium.ico changes, the profile shortcut icons (generated dynamically
at runtime) need to be migrated to the new icon. Please increment the constant
kCurrentProfileIconVersion in
chrome/browser/profiles/profile_shortcut_manager_win.cc.
